  "description": "CANO - Sousel/Portalegre.\n\nBonita Casa de Campo, com 2 entradas, totalmente remodelada e em excelente estado, MOBILADA e EQUIPADA, muito soalheira e luminosa, inserida em terreno com 1.383m2 com árvores de fruto e oliveira e bonito alpendre, no enquadramento do centro urbano da Vila do Cano. \n\nCorredor Entrada com pavimento em soalho flutuante. \n\nSala com pavimento em soalho flutuante, com salamandra a lenha. Acesso direto ao alpendre e terreno.\n\nCozinha com pavimento em soalho flutuante, móveis brancos, bancada em silestone, completamente equipada com fogão elétrico, exaustor, termoacumulador, frigorifico, micro-ondas, máquina de lavar loiça e máquina de lavar roupa. Acesso direto ao alpendre, terreno junto à entrada.\n\nQuarto 1, com pavimento em soalho flutuante.\n\nQuarto 2, com pavimento em soalho flutuante.\n\nCasa de banho com janela. Móvel, espelho e base de duche com resguardo em vidro.\n\nIsento de Licença de Utilização\n\nCANO - Sousel/Portalegre\n\nBeautiful Country House with 2 entrances, fully renovated and in excellent condition, FURNISHED and EQUIPPED, very bright and sunny, set on a 1,383m² plot with fruit trees and an olive tree, and a lovely porch, within the urban area of the village of Cano.\n\nEntrance Hall with floating wood flooring.\n\nLiving Room with floating wood flooring and a wood-burning stove. Direct access to the porch and garden.\n\nKitchen with floating wood flooring, white cabinets, silestone countertop, fully equipped with electric stove, extractor fan, water heater, refrigerator, microwave, dishwasher, and washing machine. Direct access to the porch, garden near the entrance.\n\nBedroom 1, with floating wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 2, with floating wood flooring.\n\nBathroom with window, cabinet, mirror, and shower with glass enclosure.\n\nExempt from Usage License \n\nCategoria Energética: D\n\nCANO - Sousel/Portalegre\n\nBeautiful Country House with two entrances, fully renovated and in excellent condition, FURNISHED and EQUIPPED, very bright and sunny, set on a 1,383m² plot with fruit trees and an olive tree, storage room, and a charming porch, located in the urban center of the village of Cano.\n\nEntrance Hall with floating wood flooring.\n\nLiving Room with floating wood flooring and a wood-burning stove. Direct access to the porch and garden.\n\nKitchen with floating wood flooring, white cabinetry, silestone countertop, fully equipped with eletric stove, extractor fan, water heater, fridge, microwave, dishwasher, and washing machine. Direct access to the porch, garden, and storage room near the entrance.\n\nBedroom 1 with floating wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 with floating wood flooring.\n\nBathroom with window, vanity unit, mirror, and shower with glass enclosure.\n\nExempt from Usage License \n\nEnergy Rating: D",
